WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.446
Clear goals shape motivation by giving effort a direction.

2
00:00:03.446 --> 00:00:11.869
Vague goals often fail because they do not tell people what to do next, how to recognize progress, or when to adjust.

3
00:00:11.869 --> 00:00:21.057
A goal like improve the process may sound useful, but it is hard to act on until it becomes specific enough to guide behavior.

4
00:00:21.057 --> 00:00:26.035
Clear goals reduce ambiguity and make it easier to choose the next step.

5
00:00:26.035 --> 00:00:29.097
Outcome goals and process goals serve different purposes.

6
00:00:29.097 --> 00:00:36.372
An outcome goal describes the result people want, such as finishing a project, improving quality, or passing an assessment.

7
00:00:36.372 --> 00:00:47.475
A process goal describes actions under the person's control, such as reviewing one design each day, practicing a skill for a set time, or documenting the next decision.

8
00:00:47.475 --> 00:00:51.303
Process goals are powerful because they convert intention into behavior.

9
00:00:51.303 --> 00:00:52.452
Expectancy matters too.

10
00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:57.046
People invest more effort when they believe success is possible through action.

11
00:00:57.046 --> 00:00:59.726
If the goal feels impossible, motivation drops.

12
00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.023
If it feels trivial, attention drifts.

13
00:01:02.023 --> 00:01:08.532
Useful design creates near-term targets and milestones that stretch capability without making the path feel hopeless.

14
00:01:08.532 --> 00:01:14.275
Progress signals help people see that effort is producing movement before the final outcome arrives.

15
00:01:14.275 --> 00:01:17.721
Feedback loops sustain motivation by connecting behavior to results.

16
00:01:17.721 --> 00:01:22.315
The faster and clearer the feedback, the easier it is to adjust.

17
00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:25.761
This does not mean every task needs constant scoring.

18
00:01:25.761 --> 00:01:31.887
It means people need some way to know whether they are moving in the right direction.

19
00:01:31.887 --> 00:01:39.544
Visible progress can carry people through difficult work because it turns effort from a vague hope into an observable pattern.
